{"id":"3771cb3ddfd32097","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-relation-extension.md","title":"Relation Extension","display":"df-relation-extension — Relation Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-relation-extension","aliases":["89-df-relation-extension","relation extension","关系扩张"],"display":"df-relation-extension — Relation Extension","depends_on":["[[89-df-accessibility]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-relation-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-relation-extension</span><span>relation extension</span><span>关系扩张</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relation-extension — Relation Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)\\)</span> (Kripke frame, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}&#39;=(W,R&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}&#39;=(W,R&#39;)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R&#39;\\subseteq W^2\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F&#39;)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元关系扩张谓词，两个框架使用同一载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal{F},\\mathcal{F}&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq R&#39;\\subseteq W^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal{F},\\mathcal{F}&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq R&#39;\\subseteq W^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;\">\\(R&#39;\\)</span> : 扩张后的可及关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{F}&#39;\\)</span> : 关系扩张后的框架</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关系扩张只表示扩大可及关系，本身不承诺保持有效公式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扩大可及关系可能改变某些公式的有效性</li>\n<li>关系扩张与逻辑的&quot;强度&quot;相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关系扩张的直观：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更多可及关系 ⟹ 更多&quot;可能性&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 需要更多条件才能成立</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond \\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond \\varphi\\)</span> 更容易成立</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不同类型扩张对应特定公理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自反扩张</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39; = R \\cup \\{(w, w) : w \\in W\\}\">\\(R&#39; = R \\cup \\{(w, w) : w \\in W\\}\\)</span> ⟹ T公理有效</li>\n<li><strong>传递扩张</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;=R^{+}\">\\(R&#39;=R^{+}\\)</span>（完整传递闭包）⟹ 4公理有效；\n只加一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^2\">\\(R^2\\)</span> 一般仍不传递</li>\n<li><strong>对称扩张</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39; = R \\cup \\{(v, w) : wRv\\}\">\\(R&#39; = R \\cup \\{(v, w) : wRv\\}\\)</span> ⟹ B公理有效</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GL框架的扩张敏感性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GL框架要求逆良基性</li>\n<li>若扩张破坏逆良基性（添加循环），Löb公理可能失效</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a>：被扩张的关系</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a>：扩张可能影响有效性</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>：GL框架对扩张敏感</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0ec5d35474706206\" href=\"?note=0ec5d35474706206\" title=\"89-prop-relation-extension\">89-prop-relation-extension</a>：关系扩张性质</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-accessibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)$ (Kripke frame, see [[89-df-kripke-frame]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-accessibility]]：被扩张的关系","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：扩张可能影响有效性","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]：GL框架对扩张敏感","embed":false},{"target":"89-prop-relation-extension","status":"resolved","id":"0ec5d35474706206","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-prop-relation-extension]]：关系扩张性质","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} = (W, R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}'=(W,R')","display":false},{"tex":"R'\\subseteq W^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F')","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(\\mathcal{F},\\mathcal{F}')\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq R'\\subseteq W^2.","display":true},{"tex":"R'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}'","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"R' = R \\cup \\{(w, w) : w \\in W\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R'=R^{+}","display":false},{"tex":"R^2","display":false},{"tex":"R' = R \\cup \\{(v, w) : wRv\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1975,"backlinks":[{"id":"0ec5d35474706206","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realiz